{"seq":31,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"3e80dcbd-bf76-4182-bc8f-a2092e699334","runId":"run_1_1788373921478","result":"Done! The regex has been saved to `/app/regex.txt`.\n\nHere's how the pattern works:\n\n**IPv4 validation** (`(?:0|[1-9][0-9]?|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-5])` repeated 4 times):\n- `0` - single zero\n- `[1-9][0-9]?` - 1-99\n- `1[0-9]{2}` - 100-199\n- `2[0-4][0-9]` - 200-249\n- `25[0-5]` - 250-255\n\n**Date validation** (`\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])`):\n- Year: 4 digits\n- Month: 01-12\n- Day: 01-31 (covers Feb's max of 29)\n\n**Key mechanisms**:\n- `(?<![a-zA-Z0-9])` and `(?![a-zA-Z0-9])` - Word boundaries to prevent matching partial dates/IPs\n- `.*?` (lazy) between IPv4 and date to avoid greedy over-matching\n- `(?!.*\\d{4}-...)` - Negative lookahead that only captures the date if no other dates follow it on the same line\n- Single capture group for the date so `re.findall()` returns just the dates\n\nThe pattern uses `re.MULTILINE` flag so `^` and `$` match line boundaries, matching one line at a time.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":97187,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3e80dcbd-bf76-4182-bc8f-a2092e699334","total_cost_usd":0.09408585,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14431,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":14436,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13637},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14431},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":1023,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13488,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":12,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00121